{
  "ALL_TEXT": "79 EXT. ROADSIDE DHABA - DAY\nThe trio are travelling in SULOCHANA's car, all three grim\nand sad. The radio turns on by itself. At this very moment,\nthe car gets a flat tire. VEDA and SULOCHANA get off the car.\nVEDA\nMurphy\u2019s laws!... Avakathavakalanni\nokkarojulone ochesthaayi.\nSULOCHANA opens the car's boot, pulls out the tool kit and\nthrows it at VEDA, implying him to change the flat.\nVEDA gets to work with a sigh. SULOCHANA goes and sits in the\nnearby dhaba.\nVEDA\n(Sarcastically at\nGOVARDHAN)\nAyya meeru digithe nenu tire\nmaarchutha!\nGOVARDHAN\nDiganu... neekishtamochindhi\nchesuko.\nVEDA\nEmi cheyyanu... etlaagu rendu\nhathya caselu vachestunnayi naa\nmeeda, muudodhi peddha lekka\nkaadhu.\nGOVARDHAN rushes out of the car and grabs VEDA.\nGOVARDHAN\nNijam cheppu, nuvve champaavu kada\nvaallani.\nVEDA\nKallemanna dobbaaya neku... akkade\nunnav ga... Spanner tho naalugu\npeekithe anni gurthosthaayi.\nSULOCHANA\nAbbaaaaaaaaa!!!!!!! Meeru\nkottukunte ippudu vachedemi ledu.\nVEDA\nNuvvu raaku madhyalo... neeku\nsambandham ledu indulo.. Veediki\nhelp chese nenu indulo irukkundi.\nGOVARDHAN\nAa chesaav help... nee valla ivaala\nnenu enni kashtaalu anubhavichaano\nneekem thelusu..\nVEDA\nNuvvokkadive naa.... Naaku\nkashtaale.\nGOVARDHAN\n(Harsh Whisper)\nAa Baba deggara ninnodileyyalsindi.\nVEDA\n(Trying to coax GOVARDHAN)\nAssalu emayyindi GOVARDHAN... Nuvvu\ncheppakapothe, nenu...\nGOVARDHAN is now vexed. He rips a tree branch from the side\nof the road and whips VEDA with it.\nVEDA\nAbbhaa!!! Vaatha padindi\nbandoda!!... Aipoyav ra ippudu\nnuvvu!!\nGOVARDHAN\nMalli 'ra' na???...\nVEDA\nEe saari korikaavante chudu...\npallu raalthai.\nGOVARDHAN leaves VEDA.\nGOVARDHAN\nIppaatiki ainavi chaalu... nee\ndaari needi naa daari naadi ippati\nnundi... etla unde vaadini etla\naaipoyaanu... antha nee valle...\nVEDA\nNaakuu avasaram ledu nee motha...\naedo nee kaallu pattukuni\nbathimilaaduthunnattu...\nGOVARDHAN walks away from him. VEDA dusts himself and starts\nchanging the tire. After he is done he walks angrily into the\ndhaba, pulls SULOCHANA by the hand and takes her away.\nSULOCHANA looks at VEDA and GOVARDHAN, who is sitting by the\nside of the hut. VEDA does not explain anything to her and\nmakes her sit in the passenger seat.\nVEDA\nThalaalu ivvu!\nVEDA gets into the car and looks at GOVARDHAN, giving him\nanother chance to get in.\nGOVARDHAN\nEnti chusthunnav? Bayalderu!\nVEDA shakes his head and starts the car.\nSULOCHANA\nAyyo! Okkadine ikkada\nvadilesthunnaava? Etla osthaadu?\nVEDA\n(Tightening his jaw)\nNaaku theleedu...\nVadileyyamannaadu.\nThe car moves a few hundred feet when VEDA glances with a\nlittle guilt in the rear view mirror - he sees GOVARDHAN\nrunning behind the car, waving his hands frantically. VEDA\nsmiles sarcastically, but a little relived, and stops the\ncar.\nVEDA\nThelivi thanukochinattundi...\nGOVARDHAN\nNee Bonda!... Ikkadiki ra.\nHe pulls VEDA out of the car and gets him to the dhaba's\nentrance. SULOCHANA follows them behind. GOVARDHAN points at\nthe TV, which is reporting that the ashram has been put on\nfire. They see footage of the a container near the Ashram's\nsecurity area ablaze. Three people have been suspected for\nthe arson, with photographs of GOVARDHAN and SULOCHANA\nplastered across the TV screen. ",
